OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe previously proposed extending the
OL,8,Fwait from the current five years to 10,
OL,9,Fin response to a period of high net
OL,10,Fmigration, but has faced opposition
OL,11,Ffrom within her own party for proposing
OL,12,Fto apply the changes to migrant workers
OL,13,Falready in the UK
OL,15,FThe Conservatives have said that any
OL,16,Fwatering down of the proposal would be
OL,17,Fa "slap in the face to British
OL,18,Ftaxpayers"
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
