OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndefinite leave to remain (ILR), also
OL,8,Fknown as settlement, gives a person the
OL,9,Fright to live, work and study in the UK
OL,10,Ffor as long as they like and apply for
OL,11,Fbenefits if they are eligible
